1460	The Bible relates the true story of creation in order to explain how humanity was designed to function within the world. This is why many other parts of the Bible appeal to the creation accounts to prove how the world is supposed to works and what role human beings are morally obligated to play.Theologians often refers to these obligations as creation ordinances.\n\nCreation ordinances are moral requirements established by God's work of creation.\nsometimes creation ordinances are explicit.\nExplicit ordinances: \nexample: be fruitful and multiply  (Genesis 1:28)\nImplicit ordinances:\nThe creation accounts don't say explicitly that human beings should rest every seventh day. But in the Ten commandments it says Moses certified that God's pattern of working six days and resting on the seventh day obligated human beings to do the same.\nKeep the sabbath holy(Exodus 20:11)	8	2020-04-29 23:59:43+05:30	2020-04-30 01:12:34+05:30	\N	433	589
1437	Gen 1:27-28- God created man in his own image, in the image of God he created him: male and female he created them. God blessed them and said to them, "be fruitful and increase in number, fill the earth and subdue it. Rule over the fish and the sea and the birds of the air and over every living creature that moves on the ground"\nRight after the scripture introduces us as images of God, it says that we govern creation. So, at least one important aspect of being God's image is that we hold the office of delegated ruler. In theological terms, we are God's "vice-regents"- his administrative deputies or in ancient near eastern terms, his servant or "vassal" kings.	8	2020-04-26 22:05:19+05:30	2020-04-30 01:17:38+05:30	\N	437	786
1461	BIBLICAL ACCOUNTS\nThere are two accounts of creation given in the Bible; They are:\nGENESIS 1:1 TO 2:3\nGod spent six days forming and filling the universe:\nDay 1: God separated the dark from light.\nDay 2: God separated the water above from water below.\nDay 3: God separated dry land and sea\nDay 4 :God filled the light and darkness with heavenly bodies(sun , moon ,stars)\nDay 5- God filled the sky and oceans with birds and sea creatures\nDay 6-God filled the dry land with animals and created the human beings to rule over creation\nGENESIS 2:4-25\nThis account contains more details related to God's work on the sixth day.\nGod formed the animals from the dust of the earth.\nGod made the first man from the dust of the earth and breathed life into him.\nAdam look for a suitable helper from among the animals.\nGod created Eve, the first woman from Adam's rib.\nThe two accounts differ in the way that in the second account the details of sixth day is given and about the creation of man and animals from dust. \nIn the first account the Human beings were created in God's image and given authority over creation.\nIn the second account Eve was under Adam 's authority in their marriage ,but she was equal to him in the tasks God h as assigned them as a race	9	2020-04-30 00:15:05+05:30	2020-04-30 01:12:34+05:30	\N	433	590
1462	Adam and Eve were created superior to the rest of God's earthly creations.\n1.  They were Created on the sixth day, separately from the animals as the culmination of creation .\nGenesis 1:27\n2. God called them "very good" Genesis 1:31\n3.Only Adam is said to have his life breathed into him by God. Genesis 2:7\n4. God created them in His image , and appointed them to rule over creation on his behalf (genesis 1:27-28, 9:2,Psalms 8:6-8\n\nGod created humanity to reflect his glory and his attributes in ways that other creature couldn't \nBecause human beings are likeness of God so our existence pints to his power and goodness and no other creature carries this much honor and inherent dignity \nHumanity also has superior role to administer God's rule over the earth(Genesis 2:20)\nScriptures confirm humanity's superiority by putting us almost on the level of angels in the present, and superior to the angels in the future(Psalms 8:5)	7	2020-04-30 00:25:49+05:30	2020-04-30 01:12:34+05:30	\N	433	591
1463	There had been many common beliefs in the human origins in our culture. Many religions teach different theories of origin of life. Science also has different theories:\n1. DARWINISM:- It is a theory of biological evolution which states that all species of organisms arise and develop through the natural selection of small, inherited variations that increase the individual's ability to compete , survive and reproduce. It was developed by Charles Darwin.\n2. THE BIG BANG THEORY- It is a cosmological model which describes how the universe expanded from an initial state of very density and high temperature and an explosion .\n3. SPONTANEOUS GENERATION- It states generation of life from non-living matter .\nDarwinism is false according to the Bible as each and every creature was created by God by his word and each of different species and classifications as per his command. \nBig band theory is false as earth ,sky , land  and all heavenly bodies and everything in it was created as per His command and not as a result of an explosion.\nGod gave his breath and life came to being not out of non-living matter.	8	2020-04-30 00:39:52+05:30	2020-04-30 01:12:34+05:30	\N	433	592
