1479	There are different ways ,the various parts and aspects of Scripture communicate God's norm to us. Scripture communicates in different ways. It contains statements, questions,offers, curses,threats,advice, commands,summations, desire, love and much more.It includes sarcasm and sincere language.\nLanguage \nThe bible displays the full range of language that we find in human communication. If we don't understand how each type of language communicates, we are likely to understand the Bible.\nEXTRAORDINARY-\nThose who believe that Bible speaks in extraordinary ways often oversimplify biblical language , developing a system of interpretation that can applied fairly equally to all of scripture. Because the Bible is inspired by God, it communicates in extraordinary ways that can exceed human comprehension. Many Christians also insisted that the Scriptures extraordinary nature makes its language easy to interpret. \nORDINARY-\nThe Bible communicates in ordinary language using all the normal conventions of human communication.WE have to learn how the ordinary language is used and what was each author's intent when he wrote.	9	2020-05-02 07:13:18+05:30	2020-05-05 09:51:31+05:30	\N	439	838
