1549	Scripture helps us proper understanding of our moral standard, our goals, and our motives, or to put it another way, on normative, situational and existential concerns. Failure to reach a proper ethical judgement can be caused by failure properly to assess any of these perspectives. Either through explicit or implicit teaching, the scripture provide us with a comprehensive system of ethical norms. In this sense, the bible's sufficiency is unlimited when it comes to revealing the God's will for his glory, our salvation, faith and Christian living. General and existential revelation also contain some of these norms, but they contain no additional norms beyond those found directly or indirectly in scripture. The point is simply that bible speaks sufficiently to every area of life, so that our true duty towards God is always an application of Scriptural Norms.	8	2020-05-30 22:33:18+05:30	2020-06-02 07:34:13+05:30	\N	457	836
