1752	The word ontological means being related to being. It is considering how the three persons of the Trinity are integrated with one another, and how they share a single essence. From the perspective of ontology, all three of God's persons are infinite, eternal and unchangeable. And each has the same essential divine attributes, such as wisdom, power, holiness, justice, goodness and truth. \nThe word ''economic'' means ''relating to household management.'' When we consider how God's persons interact with each other, how they relate to one another as individual persons. \nFrom both the ontological and economic perspective the Father is said to be the first person, generated by the Father, and the Holy Spirit is said to proceed from the Father. Besides being the first person of the ontological Trinity, the Father is also called the first person of the economic Trinity. \nThe Son is generated by the Father (externally generated) and Holy Spirit proceed from the Father (externally proceeds) in the ontological trinity.\nIn economic trinity, authority is over the Son and the over the Holy Spirit.	7	2020-08-04 21:30:34+05:30	2020-08-05 04:02:44+05:30	\N	510	873
