1798	The problem of sin is that it separates us from God's blessings and places under His curse. It condemns us. Apart from Christ, there is no other way to save ourselves from its presence or its consequences. Bible uses words like lawlessness, rebellion, transgression, offense, evil, and missing the mark to describe things that are sinful. It is violation of God's law. Omitting or neglecting the Law, is called the sin of omission and the transgression of law is doing what scripture forbids. This is the sin of commission. \nSin originated from the rebellion against God, when Adam and Eve disobeyed and violated God's law and willingly chose to sin. Love for God is manifested in obedience to his law. \nAnd because of this, the consequences was that God judged and cursed the entire human race resulting in Spiritual death, corruption, and physical death. Sin earned humanity eternal suffering under God's judgement in hell.	9	2020-08-19 21:09:08+05:30	2020-08-22 17:29:12+05:30	\N	521	891
