1840	They are three categories of God's revelation:\nGeneral Revelation:\nBible assures us that general revelation still speaks clearly enough to teach us true things about God, it reveals the perfect standard of God's character serves as one of God's revelation norms.some general revelation is known by so few  people that it appears to be very similar to special revelation.\nGeneral revelation a is a standard or norm for belief about God that is binding on all people., every one who acts contrarily to what God has revealed is guilty of sin.Romans 1:32\nSpecial Revelation:\nThis type of revelation is complex , coming to us in a  way number of forms. Most of theses forms rely on the spoken or written word , but all of them involve God communicating with people in ways that transcend the normal working of creation. Scripture is the most relevant form of special revelation for us today.\nExistential Revelation:\nIt is the idea that God reveals himself in and through persons has always been recognized by the  mainstream of Protestant theology as apart of general revelation. God uses human existence and judgments, and human behavior as an external type of existential behavior.Romans 2:14-15, according to Paul God also communicates truth to unbelievers through illumination. Bey	8	2020-08-29 00:31:57+05:30	2020-09-08 06:04:30+05:30	\N	527	831
