2045	In Ontological Trinity, we are focusing on God's being and existence.\nthe Holy spirit is equal in power and glory to the father and the son.\nAll three of God's persons are infinite, eternal and unchangeable.\nEach person of the god head has different responsibilities , different authority, different assigned role. the Spirit's authority is subject to the higher authority of then father and the son.\nAnd the Spirit's role is largely to carry out their instruction and to bring them glory.\nHe is the third person of the ontological trinity, because he is breathed out by the father , whos is the first person  and by the son who is the second person.\nHoly Spirit is said to be the third person because he holds the third rank, being subordinate both to the father and to the son.\nThe Holy Spirit holds the lowest rank from the perspective of the economic trinity, but it is important to emphasize that he is still fully god and has absolutely sovereign authority over every aspect of creation. within trinity , there is a sense of mutual difference, since what one person does they all do . so the holy spirit's subordination to the Father and the son does not mean that he is some how inherently inferior to them- he is not.\nHe is fully equal to them in their essential divinity.	9	2020-10-20 00:20:45+05:30	2020-10-21 23:59:41+05:30	\N	564	885
