2078	The father's association with the son and the holy spirit may be described in a number of ways .but in the history of theology two particular perspectives on the trinity have came to the foreground , specifically it has been common to speak in terms of the Ontological Trinity and the Economic Trinity , both these approaches speak of the same trinity , the father , the son and the holy spirit , but they emphasize the different aspects of the relationship between three person of the God head , \n It has been common to speak of the ontological trinity when we are focusing on God's being , the word ontological means relating to being , so when we speak the ontological trinity we are looking at the trinity in terms of being or essence , we are considering how the three person of the trinity are integrated with one another , and how they share a single essence , \nfrom the perspective of ontology all three of God's person are infinite ,eternal and unchangeable ,and each has the same essence such as wisdom, power ,holiness, justice, goodness and true .\n  We normally says that we are speking of economic trinity when we consider how God's person interact with each other ,how thay relate to one another as individual prson, The word 'economic' means relating to house hold management ,so when we speak of economic trinity we are discribing how the father son and the holy spirit relate to one another as distinct individual personalities .	7	2020-10-26 07:24:41+05:30	2020-10-27 23:55:51+05:30	\N	573	873
