2220	Our God is gloriously incomprehensible.  God is infinite. God has no limits or boundaries. He is not confined to the dimension of space. His love, holiness, mercy, and all His other qualities are unlimited in their scope and expression. God is self-existent, he had no beginning. Because He is the creator, He is the only one who exists outside of the created order. God is eternal. With God, everything that has ever happened or will ever happen has already occurred within His awareness. God encompasses all of eternity.  God is self-sufficient.  God is gloriously incomprehensible, but He is also a personal Sprit. Through His infinite love and goodness. He has provided a way for us to have an authentic, personal relationship with Him. God destroyed the barrier of sin and self-centeredness that separated us from our holy God. God sent the Holy Spirit to dwell in Christians with His presence. Our creator God did al this so we could go beyond just knowing about Him. We can actually enter into a warm friendship and intimate family relationship with Him. What a gracious God we have in Jesus!!	8	2020-11-26 09:57:17+05:30	2020-11-29 11:24:26+05:30	\N	601	856
