3201	Individual eschatology is defined as the study of how individual human beings experience the events of the last days. This is specifically relevant when considering the context around life, death, the intermediate state, and the final state or conclusion of our bodies an soul. \n\nRegenerate means being 'recreated' or 'reborn' in the terminology of theology. In terms of individuals who are spiritually alive or 'living'. While humans are considered 'born' when they receive physical life, this term is in relation to a spiritual birth which is obtained by the Holy Spirit. Our spiritual life is everlasting and eternal and that life never ends, when our earthly bodies die, our souls will continue to last forever.\n\nUnregenerate refers to human beings who are considered spiritually dead. They are defined by three characteristics, the first being their spiritual death, the second their moral inability and the last being their enmity with God. The only way to give them life is through the Holy Spirit which would allow them to 'regenerate' allowing for a rebirth spiritually. While Adam and Eve were created with spiritual life and given dominion to rule over earth, their sin caused them to be cursed and resulted in spiritual death.	8	2024-06-27 07:07:15+05:30	2024-11-21 02:02:53+05:30	\N	880	638
