11	certificate-program	Certificate Program	<h2>Certificate Program</h2>\n<p><span style="font-size: 16px; color: #000000;">Our Certificate Program is designed for believers, church leaders, and students who want a flexible and self-paced theological education. <strong>Choose your subjects to study</strong> from our rich curriculum of biblical, theological, and practical ministry courses.</span></p>\n<h3>Program Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Flexible Curriculum:</strong> Choose your subjects to study according to your ministry needs and interests.</li>\n    <li><strong>Self-Paced Learning:</strong> Study fully online at your own speed from anywhere in the world.</li>\n    <li><strong>Practical Focus:</strong> Build a solid biblical foundation for effective Christian service.</li>\n</ul>\n	Mytts Certificate Program	Mytts Certificate Program	Mytts Certificate Program	1	t	t	2026-08-06 13:31:26.810225+05:30	2026-08-06 14:19:19.146458+05:30	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	\N
5	Fees-Structure	Fees Structure	<p>The ultimate aim and vision to start Trinity Theological Seminary is to train the leaders equipping them in His Word to be effective Ministers of Gospel. Our desire is &ldquo;TTS will provide the best biblical education at the most affordable price.&rdquo; This is a nonprofit organization which offers significantly lower tuition than most traditional universities and for-profit schools with similar programming. We work with all of our students as close as we can to meet their particular budget.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width: 500px;">\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>Undergraduate Level Tuition</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Master&rsquo;s Level Tuition</td>\n\t\t\t<td>Doctoral Level Tuition</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>$100.00</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$150.00</td>\n\t\t\t<td>$200.00</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>per semester credit hour</td>\n\t\t\t<td>per semester credit hour</td>\n\t\t\t<td>per semester credit hour</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Keep in mind that these tuition costs are prior to factoring in any grants, discounts or tuition assistance. With available grants, the payment for most students taking 4-5 courses per enrollment period is between $100 and $150.00 a month depending upon degree level. To keep costs low, Trinity offers its own financing for students through deferred payments on the remaining balance of their tuition and fees not paid at the time of enrollment.</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Please call and speak with an Enrollment Advisor with any questions.</strong></em></p>	\N	\N	\N	1	f	f	2026-08-06 13:31:26.810228+05:30	2026-08-06 13:31:26.810242+05:30	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	\N
6	Scholarship	Scholarship	<p>Scholarships are available for eligible students for all courses. You can&nbsp;Email us to our email ID&nbsp;<em><strong>trinitytheologicalseminary@gmail.com</strong></em>&nbsp;with your full bio-data explaining why full or partial scholarships should be made available for you. Do remember to attach all the necessary documents along with the mail, in order for our management to verify. Applying alone does not guarantee any scholarship, as all scholarships are fully based on management discretion, which may not give any reasons whatsoever for its decisions.</p>\n\n<p>Generally, TTS Scholarships are available for the following category of students, who are economically backward having good academic grades in the qualifying exams:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Clergy (Priests &amp; Pastors) &ndash; without any discrimination to denominations or sects.</li>\n\t<li>Children or any direct dependents of the clergy.</li>\n\t<li>Bible school graduates.</li>\n\t<li>Final year graduate students.</li>\n\t<li>Mature Applicants.</li>\n\t<li>House wives.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Note: The entire above category should provide a strong letter of recommendation from the head of the local church, supported by proofs of the claims. All submitted applications will be thoroughly scrutinized by the TTS Management and is subject to exposure to other individuals as well.</p>	\N	\N	\N	1	f	f	2026-08-06 13:31:26.81023+05:30	2026-08-06 13:31:26.810243+05:30	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	\N
